# EtPositionCard Component - Agent Guide

## Overview

`EtPositionCard` is an expandable position card component with smooth expand/collapse animation. It uses a compound component pattern with structured subcomponents for consistent layout matching Figma design.

**Location:** `/libs/etoro-ui/src/components/position-card/`

## Key Features

- **Compound Component Pattern**: Flexible composition with structured subcomponents
- **Smooth Animation**: core RN `Animated` height tween (chart-safe; see Animation Mechanism)
- **Curved Handle**: Visual indicator for expand/collapse interaction (SVG-based)
- **Loading State**: Built-in skeleton placeholders
- **Controlled/Uncontrolled**: Both modes supported
- **RTL Ready**: Uses `start`/`end` instead of `left`/`right` for future RTL support
- **Positive/Negative Variants**: Different background colors based on `variant` prop
- **Hybrid Children Rendering**: Uses `Children.map` transformation for flexibility while maintaining special handling for `ExpandedContent`

## Usage

```tsx
<EtPositionCard isLoading={isLoading}>
  <EtPositionCard.Header>
    <EtPositionCard.Symbol>AAPL</EtPositionCard.Symbol>
    <EtPositionCard.Name>Apple inc</EtPositionCard.Name>
    <EtPositionCard.Price>197.93</EtPositionCard.Price>
    <EtPositionCard.Change value={1.95} percentage={-1.03} />
  </EtPositionCard.Header>

  {/* Collapsed-only chrome: animates away in sync with the fold (no layout pop) */}
  <EtPositionCard.CollapsedContent>
    <EtPositionCard.Divider />
  </EtPositionCard.CollapsedContent>

  <EtPositionCard.ExpandedContent>
    <EtLineChart {...chartProps} />
    <EtPositionCard.StatRow label="Today's Return" value="$699.95" />
  </EtPositionCard.ExpandedContent>

  <EtPositionCard.Footer>
    <EtPositionCard.CollapsedContent>
      <EtPositionCard.Label>Net Value</EtPositionCard.Label>
    </EtPositionCard.CollapsedContent>
    <EtPositionCard.Action icon="share" onPress={handleShare} />
    <EtPositionCard.Value>$1,699.19</EtPositionCard.Value>
    <EtPositionCard.SecondaryInfo start={<EtPositionCard.Change value={699.95} percentage={69.3} />} end="6.921 shares" />
  </EtPositionCard.Footer>
</EtPositionCard>
```

## Subcomponents

| Component         | Description                                      |
| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |
| `Header`          | Container for top section                        |
| `Symbol`          | Asset symbol (e.g., "AAPL")                      |
| `Name`            | Asset name (e.g., "Apple inc")                   |
| `Price`           | Current price display                            |
| `Change`          | Price change with up/down indicator              |
| `Divider`         | Horizontal divider line                          |
| `ExpandedContent` | Animated section, height 0→full as card expands  |
| `CollapsedContent`| Inverse of ExpandedContent: collapsed-only chrome, height full→0 as card expands |
| `StatRow`         | Label + value stat row                           |
| `Footer`          | Container for bottom section                     |
| `Label`           | Label text (e.g., "Net Value")                   |
| `Value`           | Large value text (e.g., "$1,699.19")             |
| `SecondaryInfo`   | Secondary info row (start + end for RTL support) |
| `Action`          | Action button (e.g., share icon)                 |

